<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1">Every element of the valley works against you — the soil yields reluctantly, the weather turns without warning, and the Blight spreads with a patience that feels almost deliberate.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve">土壌は渋々ながら収穫し、天候は何の前触れもなく変わり、疫病はほとんど意図的とも感じられる忍耐強さで広がっていく。</target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-context">long description</context>
</context-group>
<note>some comments, such as codes and character limits for the long description.</note>
